  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Women in Leadership in Samoa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women in Leadership in Samoa Joint Programme supports stakeholders in addressing challenges to women&#x2019;s representation and civic engagement. Activities enhance all women&#x2019;s leadership to take sustainable action in their communities. Initiatives also support women candidates planning to run in the 2021 elections, as well as Members of Parliament in operationalizing the SDGs and 2030 Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
